{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e290c49fa87db864","type":"text","text":"## Operations Center\n**Modularer Monolith**\nNext.js 16 + Drizzle + PostgreSQL\nDual Interface: Web-UI + Agent\nCloudsigma Linux VM","x":-270,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":140},
		{"id":"ui_layer","type":"text","text":"## Zwei Zugaenge (API-First)\n\n**Web-UI** — Founder-Dashboard, Support, Kunden-Portal\n**Agent/MCP** — Automatisierung\n\nGleiche API, gleiche Rechte","x":-200,"y":-800,"width":400,"height":320},
		{"id":"bb09010e16801a5e","type":"text","text":"## 1. CRM (Prio 1)","x":-540,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"07073264731d48ba","type":"text","text":"Lead erfassen","x":-980,"y":-570,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9e38116fc0862b28","type":"text","text":"Kundenverwaltung","x":60,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d36f06bc8160bd08","type":"text","text":"Gutscheinverwaltung","x":60,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"237a51bdd18094a9","type":"text","text":"Benutzerverwaltung (Ops-Center)","x":-960,"y":-360,"width":280,"height":60},
		{"id":"a7f386b626f1f529","type":"text","text":"## 2. Lifecycle (Prio 2)","x":180,"y":-80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"03c13bb93bcf9f0e","type":"text","text":"Update / Deployment\n*1-Klick alle Mandanten updaten*\n*Agent-automatisiert*","x":180,"y":100,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"28608238b90ca215","type":"text","text":"Plattform-Monitoring\n*Uptime, Fehler, DB-Gesundheit*","x":540,"y":-140,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"rel_mgmt","type":"text","text":"Release Management\n*Versionen, Changelog, Rollout*","x":540,"y":-20,"width":280,"height":80},
		{"id":"devops_box","type":"text","text":"## Azure DevOps Integration\n\n- Pipelines triggern (Test/Integration/Prod)\n- Releases abfragen\n- Build-Status lesen\n- Pro Mandant: welche Version laeuft","x":540,"y":120,"width":340,"height":160},
		{"id":"env_box","type":"text","text":"## Environments\n\nProduction / Integration / Test\nRelease waehlen → Environment waehlen → Deploy","x":540,"y":320,"width":340,"height":120},
		{"id":"5b01725c9383d6fb","type":"text","text":"## 3. Onboarding (Prio 3)","x":-340,"y":200,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d717d640f0af91ba","type":"text","text":"Agent Neue Plattform\n*Automatisiert Radar aufsetzen*\n*Triggert MCP Server*","x":-540,"y":360,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"7d064ee2e3ca66e0","type":"text","text":"Agent Monitoring\n*Token-Tracking + Nutzungs-Analyse*\n*Churn-Risiko erkennen*","x":-180,"y":360,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"a2179c61a811f6df","type":"text","text":"## 4. Ticket (Prio 4)","x":-700,"y":-80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"210faac8d8deee24","type":"text","text":"Supportanfrage","x":-920,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0c1036aa66eb4c69","type":"text","text":"Agent Auto Ticket Antwort","x":-1140,"y":-80,"width":280,"height":60},
		{"id":"ff6171d8c11a0ea1","type":"text","text":"Bug Reports / Feature Requests","x":-920,"y":60,"width":280,"height":60},
		{"id":"db_decision","type":"text","text":"## DB-Architektur (Entschieden)\n\n**Multi-DB beibehalten**\n1 DB pro Mandant (cin_demo, cin_hgc, cin_jura)\n+ eigene Ops-DB fuer Operations Center\n\nUpdates via Lifecycle-Agent automatisiert","x":180,"y":480,"width":380,"height":360},
		{"id":"infra_box","type":"text","text":"## Infrastruktur\n\n**Cloudsigma Linux** (Migration laeuft)\nAlles auf einem Server:\n- Operations Center (Next.js)\n- MCP-Server-API (Fastify)\n- MCP Server\n- PostgreSQL DBs","x":-540,"y":480,"width":340,"height":180},
		{"id":"stack_box","type":"text","text":"## Stack (Entschieden)\n\n- Next.js 16 (App Router)\n- React 19 + TypeScript\n- Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL\n- Eigene Auth (JWT + TOTP)\n- Cloudsigma Linux VM\n- pm2 + nginx\n- Azure DevOps Pipelines","x":270,"y":-800,"width":320,"height":340},
		{"id":"auth_box","type":"text","text":"## Auth (3 Rollen)\n\n**Admin** — Founder (Bruno/Mischa/Alex/Urs)\n**Support** — Mitarbeiter (spaeter)\n**Kunde** — Portal (Tickets, Rechnungen)\n\nEigene Auth: JWT + TOTP 2FA","x":-710,"y":-780,"width":340,"height":240},
		{"id":"8fead0edafadfb8a","type":"text","text":"Payment / Stripe","x":-325,"y":-460,"width":250,"height":60}
	],
